# Replace the input-method proxy with an inert stub. It is built on socketpair(2), which Samsara has no syscall for. The interface is preserved so all three call sites (fbshell, fbshellman, input) keep compiling unchanged, and fd() stays -1 so the io dispatcher never selects on it. This also removes the only C++ standard library header fbterm used anywhere.
#
# Generated with `git diff` against the pinned fbterm commit
# 419c6be55413a7069fbcc66883d58caa94ba3933. Regenerate with
# ports/fbterm/build.sh; never edit by hand.

